# x-sailjail-description = Voice messages to text
# x-sailjail-long-description = Hand a voice message to the offline speech-to-text service and read back the text

# Converting a received voice message to text, on request: xmatic hands a WAV
# it decoded itself to the offline speech-to-text service and reads back the
# text. Talking to that one service and hearing its signals, nothing else.
# Without a program that owns the name, the permission grants nothing.

dbus-user.talk org.mkiol.Speech
dbus-user.broadcast org.mkiol.Speech=org.mkiol.Speech.*@/*
